      align: [center, middle]
      lineHeight: 1.35
      text: |
        <p style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:13px; color:$ink"><strong>⑤ 凭证托管</strong></span></p>
        <p style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11px; color:$muted">一次粘贴 · 到期提醒</span></p>
  - elementId: p1-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 268, 280, 150]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: $hairline}
  - elementId: p1-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [76, 280, 248, 22]
    content: {fontSize: 14, bold: true, color: $accent, wrap: false, text: 管什么}
  - elementId: p1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [76, 308, 248, 96]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: $text
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: 前端工程源码、A2UI 页面描述（page.json）、模板锁定壳与依赖清单。云端仓库是权威来源：换机、误删都能克隆恢复。
  - elementId: p2-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [356, 268, 280, 150]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: $hairline}
  - elementId: p2-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [372, 280, 248, 22]
    content: {fontSize: 14, bold: true, color: $accent, wrap: false, text: 怎么管}
  - elementId: p2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [372, 308, 248, 96]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: $text
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: 每轮对话 / 保存触发静默同步；提交前自动拉取，冲突先交给 AI。用户可选「保留我的 / 用云端的」，无需理解 commit、branch。
  - elementId: p3-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [652, 268, 280, 150]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: $hairline}
  - elementId: p3-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [668, 280, 248, 22]
    content: {fontSize: 14, bold: true, color: $accent, wrap: false, text: 用户不碰什么}
  - elementId: p3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [668, 308, 248, 96]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: $text
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: 不碰 Node / npm / Git 命令行，不碰冲突解决界面。凭证一次粘贴后长期托管——代码管理对用户完全透明。
  - elementId: bottom-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 440, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: $hairline}
  - elementId: bottom-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 456, 840, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      bold: true
      color: $accent
      wrap: false
      text: 价值：代码始终有仓、有快照、可恢复 —— 为 A2UI 生成与低成本发布提供稳定底座。
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 506, 400, 16]
    content: {style: $small, wrap: false, text: 应用广场 · 用户应用开发 · 周会同步}
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 506, 40, 16]
    content: {style: $small, wrap: false, align: [right, top], text: "02"}
